1. Heat the food in the microwave.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (heated food)
   )
   ```

2. Move the heated food to the desk.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_on food livingroom_desk)
   )
   ```

3. Place the water bottle on the desk.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_on water_bottle livingroom_desk)
   )
   ```

4. Place the eggs in the egg container.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_in eggs egg_container)
   )
   ```